  "2026-08-30T20:59:40.226Z",pi-agent,"Findings 3890498690, 3890498693, 3890498698, and 3890503626 addressed. Eleven closed items were released through pinned pm and no longer retain claim_principal. npm option traversal now has one token generator shared by literal and dynamic paths. Direct scalar publishers followed only by options and wrapped option-separated scalar forms fail closed, while an explicit gh wrapper-tail control stays clean. Source-only revert counts ended [0,0] instead of [1,1], SOURCE_ONLY_REVERT_EXIT=1. npm test passed 420/420; coverage is 100% lines/branches/functions; real verifier and typecheck pass."
